{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S03、S06、S13等处把具体的音色、动作和情绪转折压缩成概括提示，细腻度及与音乐具体乐句的贴合不如X。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的左栏把心理变化写成完整、顺着因果发展的句子，右栏短词作为感受补充，普通观众更容易边听边跟上人物从离开、想念、犹疑到暂缓决定、继续生活的过程。X的重点加亮和到点出现的感受更有利于抓住关键，也提供了更丰富细腻的音乐体验，但整体信息切分较碎，部分感受描述需要观众不断转换注意力。综合实际观看时的理解连贯性和阅读负担，我会选Y。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f5b72f4a-00df-4563-8e6d-85ad9e021d8b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T205509348113Z", "elapsed_seconds": 113.281, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T20:57:02.643729+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5473894baa7357cfdfbaa4cccef6c44d76116799fa4ab40cb7f290b4e4421056", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachme